    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d440">

                <pb facs="0686" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg666"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-07-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 30, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: Recurring to your note of the 27th
                    ultimo, in regard to the losses entailed upon manufacturers in Canada by the
                    prohibition of the exportation of anthracite coal from the United States, I have
                    the honor to enclose, for your lordship’s information, a copy of an Executive
                    order of this date, modifying the previous one to such an extent as will, if the
                    conditions thereof are fulfilled on the part of the authorities of her Majesty’s
                    province, remedy the evil complained of.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, my lord, your obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d440-a1.xml" xpointer="d440-a1"/>
